== For students

If you are looking for a prethesis, thesis, or internship project, the
[prospective.html Prospective Students] page explains the process, the requirements, and the
topics that are currently open. Please read it before contacting me.

If you are already working with me, the [courses.html Courses] page collects lecture slides and
the [publications.html Publications] page collects the papers we build on.

== Other academic activities

- Associate Editor, /Example Transactions on Communications/.
- Guest editor of a special issue on learning-based network optimization.
- Member of the department seminar committee.
- Outreach: annual "women in engineering" mentoring programme.

== Credits

This website is generated from plain-text jemdoc sources with jemdoc + MathJax, and is served
by GitHub Pages. The source lives in the repository
[https://github.com/phuongluuvo/phuongluuvo.github.io phuongluuvo.github.io on GitHub].

